{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人黃心穎2023年10月27日與樂隊RubberBand鼓手黎萬宏（泥鯭）結婚，昨日（27日）是他們結婚3周年，夫妻簡簡單單打邊爐慶祝，泥鯭識做地送花氹老婆，黃心穎po出花束外，還po出一籃打邊爐的青菜，驟眼看上去似另一束花。</p><p>結婚3周年又</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T06:21:17.779093+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T06:01:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T06:18:17.525794+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T06:18:17.525794+00:00","content_hash":"ad5e79544f153f7fe2e70a6f876b8778b13e2af81ebf33919a6366ec71db2f10","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}